，风里来雨里去，还得应付各种各样的人，回到家大概只想瘫着。你说“这样下去有什么意思”，我听着像是累之外，还有点空。这份空，是最近才有，还是干这行之前就有？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"送外卖确实累，风里来雨里去，还得应付各种各样的人，回到家大概只想瘫着。你说“这样下去有什么意思”，我听着像是累之外，还有点空。这份空，是最近才有，还是干这行之前就有？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1772,"promptTokens":2285,"completionTokens":122,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:58:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057105113568474,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67cf3f4429d1fd72f7e66","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794538739297,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:58:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67cf3f4429d1fd72f7e66","chatId":"0ec6c067382a49b8bdc7e55a419b0b79","sessionId":null,"userId":99882,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最近……就是又换了个活儿，送外卖的，跑起来累得要命，还得跟各种人打交道。我干着干着就觉得，这样下去到底有什么意思呢。<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":14,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057105113568474,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af67cf3f4429d1fd72f7e67","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794538739294,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:58:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["担忧","失望","不自信","焦虑","压抑","自我否定"],"originalText":["我有点怕。","就是最近老觉得难受，可又说不太清楚为什么。","就是觉得心里堵得慌。","我是不是挺没用的。","这样下去到底有什么意思呢。","我怕她觉得我在找借口。","就觉得自己好像真的哪儿都不如别人。","我连基础都没有。","我怕自己练两天就坚持不下去了。"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"来访者因职业方向不清、自我否定及家人评价而困扰，在咨询中探索自身感受、尝试设定小目标并建立初步行动信心。"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67cedf4429d1fd72f7e5d","chatId":"0ec6c067382a49b8bdc7e55a419b0b79","sessionId":null,"userId":99882,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"说不清楚也没关系，有些感受本来就像雾，慢慢才看清轮廓。我留意到你刚才说“又好像最近才特别厉害”——那最近这段时间，是发生了什么，让这种感觉变重了吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"说不清楚也没关系，有些感受本来就像雾，慢慢才看清轮廓。我留意到你刚才说“又好像最近才特别厉害”——那最近这段时间，是发生了什么，让这种感觉变重了吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1975,"promptTokens":2164,"completionTokens":96,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:58:53"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00591063952667079,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67cedf4429d1fd72f7e5c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794538733594,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:58:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67cedf4429d1fd72f7e5c","chatId":"0ec6c067382a49b8bdc7e55a419b0b79","sessionI